-- and the named slugs only. The id lists live in integer[] locals rather than temp tables:
-- a data-only migration that sorts after the newest drizzle snapshot may not declare an
-- object, and scripts/test-vr-corrections.mjs reads any CREATE of a TABLE as a declaration
-- regardless of how temporary it is.
